      "text": [
        "2035 - وَ رُوِيَ: «أَنَّهُ لاَ يُقَالُ فِيهِ وَ رَزَقَنَا مِنْ بَهِيمَةِ اَلْأَنْعَامِ فَإِنَّ ذَلِكَ فِي أَيَّامِ اَلتَّشْرِيقِ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2035 - It is narrated:\n\"It is not said in it (the Takbir for Eid al-Fitr), 'and He provided us with the livestock of cattle,' as that phrase pertains to the days of Tashreeq (the days following Eid al-Adha).\""
        ]
      }
